{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'MC(08|09|10|11|12|18|26)|P04|G1\\\\b|G3\\\\b|G15\\\\b|G16\\\\b' MISSION_CONTROL.md docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md docs/plans/accounting-product-design-checkpoint.md docs/plans/accounting-master-checkpoint.md data/accounting-master/next-plan.md\nrg -n 'canonical_json|plan_hash|def .*hash|pre-edit-files' scripts/accounting_master_support.py scripts/run_accounting_master.py\nsed -n '294,335p' tests/test_accounting_p04.py\"","aggregated_output":"data/accounting-master/next-plan.md:5:Next eligible phase: P04.\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:10:| P00 — Verify the accepted baseline | accepted_internal | All G1–G18 retain work; bounded reference checks do not establish accounting or forecast validity. |\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:12:| P02 — Complete the bounded Apple case preparation | accepted_internal | The previous structured review returned AGREE, but its process record reports timeout; supervisor acceptance remains pending.; Complete note semantics, remaining indentures, series certificates and omitted instruments remain unresolved through specific recorded source routes.; Historical retained-byte availability and whole-document representation equivalence remain unestablished.; Debt/swap allocation, noncash movements, asset cohorts and contingent outcomes remain unidentified.; Selected identities do not establish full accounting validity, empirical forecast validity or human acceptance. All G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; Two temporary-file tests could not be independently rerun in this read-only environment; their passing status relies on the matching supervisor check record and inspected test code.; Complete agreement semantics, remaining indentures, series certificates and omitted instruments remain unresolved through specific recorded source routes.; Historical availability of retained bytes and whole-document representation equivalence remain unestablished.; Selected reconciliations establish neither full-company accounting validity nor empirical forecast validity. Human acceptance remains pending; all G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; This review changed no files. |\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:13:| P03 — Implement source lowering and shared IR | accepted_internal | General language support, arbitrary and cross-company mappings, and broader uncertainty remain incomplete; G2, G12 and G15 remain open.; Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, authoring superiority and human acceptance are not established.; Git provenance remains unavailable; recorded content hashes provide file provenance.; General package loading and overrides, events, postings, journals, runtime execution, arbitrary mappings, multiple entities/books/observations, currencies/calendars, cross-company mappings and broader uncertainty remain unsupported.; In-place checker execution was blocked by the read-only workspace; the same checker passed in a disposable writable copy with only expected temporary-path and timing differences. |\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:14:| P04 — Implement reconstruction and numerical operations | running | Repair allowance exhausted for this invocation; retain partial work and refresh the next slice. |\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:29:  \"phase\": \"P04\",\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.md:32:    \"Command failed (timeout); inspect data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-2/review_result-2.log\"\nMISSION_CONTROL.md:147:Use the [G1–G18 work allocation](docs/design/review/internal-before-expert.md)\nMISSION_CONTROL.md:167:original [G1–G10 audit](docs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md) and the\nMISSION_CONTROL.md:204:records G1–G18 repairs and remaining obligations. All MC01–MC34 assessments\ndocs/plans/accounting-master-checkpoint.md:4:The executable catalog covers G1–G18 while retaining MC01–MC35 unchanged.\ndocs/plans/accounting-mas